    "updated_at": "2022-02-27T22:02:32Z",
    "body": "Hmm, `createExpression` looks to have hit 0.3% recently: [V8XPathEvaluator_CreateExpression_Method](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/854).\r\n\r\n[DocumentXPathCreateExpression](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/295) is also up to about 0.025%.\r\n\r\nI'm not quite sure what the deal is with these two feature values; it's best I post this before I look too far down that rabbit hole or I might forget entirely ...",
