    "created_at": "2023-07-17T08:19:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-17T08:19:58Z",
    "body": "An attempt at a DOM to XPath XDM has been made at https://qt4cg.org/specifications/xpath-functions-40/Overview.html#html. Feedback is welcome.\r\n\r\nNote that this needs to add a conversion mode for not processing namespaces so that when namespaces are enabled it will correctly map XHTML documents and when disabled it will correctly map HTML documents. -- The exact mechanism for this (likely an additional processing option) has not been agreed yet.\r\n\r\nIt attempts to deal with the various willful violations of the XPath/XML data model in a way that it can handle the different flavours of (X)HTML in the corresponding `fn:parse-html` function. This includes things like the non-conforming handling of template elements.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
